-- The hollow: level two, and the only one that scrolls on both axes — 64x32
-- against a screen that is 40x28 at its largest and 20x18 at its smallest.
--
-- The route up is a climb, not a ladder: the thorns at rows 13 and 20 make one
-- of the two ways past each of them wrong, so the level is read rather than
-- held right on.

tile #  wall     solid  rockwall.svg
tile o  post     solid  stoneblock.svg
tile _  bedrock  solid  bedrock.svg
tile =  ledge    solid  shelf.svg
tile ^  spikes          spikes.svg
tile *  exit            gate.svg
tile .  air             dark.svg

map
